{"id":"n87709-2-8","stage":4,"title":"허름하다 · 破烂","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87709-2-8-1","ko":"방은 구했어요?","zh":"房间找好了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"방은","meaning":"房间","explanation":"방：房间；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29724","senseId":"1","lemma":"방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"구했어요?","meaning":"找，弄，求","explanation":"구하다：找，弄，求；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"구하다","audio":"/audio/288eb4bbfc0c27cc5bf6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58299","senseId":"1","lemma":"구하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"76102fe82462d111","term":"방","zh":"房间","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3","entryId":"29724","definition":"人为了生活或工作而用墙壁围绕和外界隔绝的空间。","pronunciation":["방"]},{"id":"288eb4bbfc0c27cc","term":"구하다","zh":"找，弄，求","audio":"/audio/288eb4bbfc0c27cc5bf6.mp3","entryId":"58299","definition":"为得到需要的东西而寻找；或指寻找以求得到。","pronunciation":["구하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/618e859a4b20071f82f3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87709-2-8-2","ko":"네. 허름한 옥탑방 하나를 얻었어요.","zh":"嗯，找到了一个破旧的阁楼房间。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"허름한","meaning":"破烂，不值钱","explanation":"허름하다：破烂，不值钱；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"허름하다","audio":"/audio/39f1b6e5e1d6ac06d217.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87709","senseId":"2","lemma":"허름하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옥탑방","meaning":"屋顶房、顶楼小屋","explanation":"옥탑방：屋顶房、顶楼小屋","readings":[{"term":"옥탑방","audio":"/audio/d7b873a874c60080cca9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:옥탑방:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"옥탑방","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"하나를","meaning":"一","explanation":"하나：一；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20279","senseId":"1","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얻었어요.","meaning":"租，租到","explanation":"얻다：租，租到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"얻다","audio":"/audio/e9a48e141ad07674b586.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73863","senseId":"5","lemma":"얻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"39f1b6e5e1d6ac06","term":"허름하다","zh":"破烂，不值钱","audio":"/audio/39f1b6e5e1d6ac06d217.mp3","entryId":"87709","definition":"看上去很廉价。","pronunciation":["허름하다"]},{"id":"d7b873a874c60080","term":"옥탑방","zh":"屋顶房、顶楼小屋","audio":"/audio/d7b873a874c60080cca9.mp3","definition":"建在建筑物屋顶上的房间。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"556dcbf069a950eb","term":"하나","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3","entryId":"20279","definition":"数数时的第一个数字。","pronunciation":["하나"]},{"id":"e9a48e141ad07674","term":"얻다","zh":"租，租到","audio":"/audio/e9a48e141ad07674b586.mp3","entryId":"73863","definition":"租借房子等。","pronunciation":["얻ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/fd0516b3b84492d4aeb2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.41,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=87709","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":126,"sequenceScore":2.2367,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["房间找好了吗？","嗯，找到了一个破旧的阁楼房间。","这里要怎么出去呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["房间找好了吗？","嗯，找到了一个破旧的阁楼房间。","这里要怎么出去呢？"],"answer":1}]}
